  "8664-january": {
    "matter_id": "W.P.(C) 8664/2021",
    "order_date": "2025-01-30",
    "page_count": 6,
    "passages": [
      {
        "matter_id": "W.P.(C) 8664/2021",
        "order_date": "2025-01-30",
        "page": 6,
        "passage_id": "jan-disposition",
        "sha256": "a0ddb33e46ce9d1d6d017dd715da57cf57afb0a6e677fa74c91318de721f84a5",
        "source_version_id": "8664-january",
        "text": "11. The petition is allowed in the aforesaid terms.",
        "text_sha256": "288466a1eae3462f181a12afe0e2812a6339e595e4078789f6ab6c9491065172",
        "url": "https://delhihighcourt.nic.in/app/showFileJudgment/VIB30012025CW86642021_112417.pdf"
      },
      {
        "matter_id": "W.P.(C) 8664/2021",
        "order_date": "2025-01-30",
        "page": 3,
        "passage_id": "jan-finding",
        "sha256": "a0ddb33e46ce9d1d6d017dd715da57cf57afb0a6e677fa74c91318de721f84a5",
        "source_version_id": "8664-january",
        "text": "7. In view of the above, the respondent’s contention that a notice under Section 12(2) of the LA Act was served on the petitioner must be rejected and the petitioner’s contention that he has not received any notice must be accepted.",
        "text_sha256": "d2950fc0c567c42cfff19c263489fa96626caae1251ff06b1d7b442beee962aa",
        "url": "https://delhihighcourt.nic.in/app/showFileJudgment/VIB30012025CW86642021_112417.pdf"
      },
      {
        "matter_id": "W.P.(C) 8664/2021",
        "order_date": "2025-01-30",
        "page": 6,
        "passage_id": "jan-lac-action",
        "sha256": "a0ddb33e46ce9d1d6d017dd715da57cf57afb0a6e677fa74c91318de721f84a5",
        "source_version_id": "8664-january",
        "text": "The LAC is directed to forward the petitioner’s reference as expeditiously as possible, preferably within a period of four weeks from today, to the concerned court.",
        "text_sha256": "0e19ac089a5053926ed6f40ea05924a6c206a935a61c543a42cc4673bdb49f25",
        "url": "https://delhihighcourt.nic.in/app/showFileJudgment/VIB30012025CW86642021_112417.pdf"
      },
      {
        "matter_id": "W.P.(C) 8664/2021",
        "order_date": "2025-01-30",
        "page": 2,
        "passage_id": "jan-lac-claim",
        "sha256": "a0ddb33e46ce9d1d6d017dd715da57cf57afb0a6e677fa74c91318de721f84a5",
        "source_version_id": "8664-january",
        "text": "5. The LAC has filed a counter affidavit affirming that on 10.02.2012 a notice under Section 12(2) of the LA Act was issued and the same was ‘duly served upon the petitioner’.",
        "text_sha256": "000bd5a317d91719aa1b42a9b650b4f6fe89ded014c9c7f3c1d6d6d3be1dcead",
        "url": "https://delhihighcourt.nic.in/app/showFileJudgment/VIB30012025CW86642021_112417.pdf"
      },
      {
        "matter_id": "W.P.(C) 8664/2021",
        "order_date": "2025-01-30",
        "page": 3,
        "passage_id": "jan-lac-correction",
        "sha256": "a0ddb33e46ce9d1d6d017dd715da57cf57afb0a6e677fa74c91318de721f84a5",
        "source_version_id": "8664-january",
        "text": "6. The learned counsel appearing for the LAC fairly states that the averments made in the counter affidavit may not be entirely correct as the record does not reflect any service of the notice to the petitioner.",
        "text_sha256": "2a927af771b1fc634478f79ffb10a1e2279721a0e6baeffeb20e4901e1271be2",
        "url": "https://delhihighcourt.nic.in/app/showFileJudgment/VIB30012025CW86642021_112417.pdf"
      },
      {
        "matter_id": "W.P.(C) 8664/2021",
        "order_date": "2025-01-30",
        "page": 6,
        "passage_id": "jan-set-aside",
        "sha256": "a0ddb33e46ce9d1d6d017dd715da57cf57afb0a6e677fa74c91318de721f84a5",
        "source_version_id": "8664-january",
        "text": "The impugned order declining the petitioner’s prayer to forward reference under Section 18 of the LA Act, is set aside.",
        "text_sha256": "1b56aca690753306c584b2ad5dfa87b72134235ff876b69243b2d3b4c1dc3357",
        "url": "https://delhihighcourt.nic.in/app/showFileJudgment/VIB30012025CW86642021_112417.pdf"
      }
    ],
